e, "translation": {"bs": "od svoje žene", "en": "his wife", "bn": "তার স্ত্রী", "fa": "همسرش", "fr": "sa femme", "id": "istrinya", "tr": "karısını", "ur": "اپنی بیوی سے"}}]}, {"arabic": "لَا يُطَلِّقُ الْعَاقِلُ فِي الْغَضَبِ", "spoken": "audio/e5d0ec662111f7940b7d.m4a", "tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "translation": {"bs": "Razuman čovjek se ne razvodi u ljutnji.", "en": "A sensible man does not divorce in anger.", "bn": "বুদ্ধিমান ব্যক্তি রাগের বশে তালাক দেয় না।", "fa": "مرد عاقل در خشم طلاق نمی‌دهد.", "fr": "Le sage ne répudie pas sous le coup de la colère.", "id": "Orang yang bijak tidak menceraikan karena marah.", "tr": "Akıllı adam öfkeyle boşamaz.", "ur": "عقلمند آدمی غصے میں طلاق نہیں دیتا۔"}, "independentlyReviewed": true, "words": [{"arabic": "لَا", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "ne", "en": "not", "bn": "না", "fa": "نه", "fr": "ne… pas", "id": "tidak", "tr": "değil", "ur": "نہیں"}}, {"arabic": "يُطَلِّقُ", "target": true, "translation": {"bs": "razvodi se", "en": "divorces", "bn": "তালাক দেয়", "fa": "طلاق می‌دهد", "fr": "divorce", "id": "menceraikan", "tr": "boşar", "ur": "وہ طلاق دیتا ہے"}}, {"arabic": "الْعَاقِلُ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "razuman čovjek", "en": "the reasonable", "bn": "ন্যায়সঙ্গত", "fa": "عاقل", "fr": "l'homme raisonnable", "id": "yang wajar", "tr": "akıllı", "ur": "عقلمند"}}, {"arabic": "فِي", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "u", "en": "in", "bn": "মধ্যে", "fa": "در", "fr": "dans", "id": "di", "tr": "içinde", "ur": "میں"}}, {"arabic": "الْغَضَبِ", "target": false, "translation": {"bs": "ljutnji", "en": "anger", "bn": "রাগ", "fa": "خشم", "fr": "à la colère", "id": "kemarahan", "tr": "öfke", "ur": "غصہ"}}]}, {"arabic": "طَلَّقُوا الْكَسَلَ", "spoken": "audio/f087bc9653b02f8047c2.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "translation": {"bs": "Oprostili su se od lijenosti.", "en": "They said goodbye to laziness.", "bn": "তারা অলসতাকে বিদায় জানাল।", "fa": "با تنبلی خداحافظی کردند.", "fr": "Ils ont d